          "role": "user",
          "content": "<email_document>\nFrom: elena.devries@atlantic-shelf.example\nSubject: Bunker offer Scheldt Express / Brest\n\nDear colleagues,\n\nThank you for your enquiry. We are pleased to offer as follows:\n\nVessel          IMO 9487081\nDelivery port   Brest\nDates           23 Nov +/- 1 day\nProduct         MGO\nQuantity        100 mts\nOffer price     US$ 748.50 pmt\nBarge           included in the price\nValid till      2026-11-16 1200 UTC\n\nSupply subject to port and weather conditions.\nPrices exclude any local taxes, if applicable.\n\nKind regards,\nElena de Vries\nBunker Trader\nFor and on behalf of Atlantic Shelf Fuels\nT +48 64 7536 6902 | elena.devries@atlantic-shelf.example\n</email_document>"
        }
